ADDITIONAL NOTICE / 附加声明

This project contains INTENTIONALLY VULNERABLE code located in the
`vuln-target/src/main/java/com/target/vuln/` package. Such code exists solely
for security education and defensive research purposes, and is isolated,
clearly annotated, and never intended for production deployment.

本项目在 `vuln-target/src/main/java/com/target/vuln/` 包中包含**故意构造的
漏洞代码**。此类代码仅用于安全教学与防御性研究，已做隔离与显式注释标注，
严禁部署至任何生产或公网环境。

Users must comply with all applicable laws and regulations. Any attack testing
must be performed only in isolated environments against systems you own or have
explicit written authorization to test.

使用者须遵守所在司法辖区的全部适用法律法规。任何攻击测试仅可在隔离环境中
针对自有或已获得明确书面授权的系统执行。
